<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>My Portfolio</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f6f7f4;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --ink: #1d2a2a;
    --muted: #5d6b6b;
    --accent: #1f6f6b;
    --line: #d9dfdc;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #121a1a;
      --surface: #1a2424;
      --ink: #e8efee;
      --muted: #9fb0ae;
      --accent: #5cc4bd;
      --line: #2c3a3a;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }

  header {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav {
    max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    padding: 14px 24px; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .brand { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  nav a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: .95rem; }
  nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  main { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  section { padding: 72px 0 24px; scroll-margin-top: 60px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin-bottom: 28px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); display: inline-block; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  p { max-width: 62ch; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: .95rem; }

  /* About */
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
  .photo {
    width: 240px; height: 240px; object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--line);
  }
  .role { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 18px; }

  /* Skills */
  .skills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .skill {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
  }
  .skill img { width: 40px; height: 40px; object-fit: contain; background: var(--line); border-radius: 6px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .skill span { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; }

  /* Education */
  .timeline { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding-left: 28px; display: grid; gap: 28px; }
  .edu { display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .edu img { width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; background: var(--line); border-radius: 8px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* Projects */
  .projects { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .project {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .project img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; background: var(--line); display: block; }
  .project .body { padding: 18px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .tags { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tags span { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 10px; color: var(--muted); }

  footer { max-width: 960px; margin: 72px auto 0; padding: 28px 24px 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; justify-items: start; }
    .photo { width: 180px; height: 180px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav aria-label="Main">
    <span class="brand">Meg Ryan F. Palo</span>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#about">About Me</a></li>
      <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
      <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- ABOUT ME -->
  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <div class="about">
      <img class="photo" src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/received_988540380949926~2.jpeg" alt="Photo of Your Name">
      <div>
        <h3>Hi, I'm</h3>
        <H1>Meg Ryan F. Palo</H1>
        <p class="role">Aspiring IT Professional</p>
        <p> I'm a BSIS student with big goals: to build a successful career and give my family the better future they deserve. I thrive when there's a lot on my plate, juggling several tasks at once and staying on top of them, and I'm at my best when the work is challenging, because that's where I learn the most. I want to grow into a professional who turns difficult problems into solutions, and who proves that hard work and determination can open doors.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills">
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <div class="skills">
      <div class="skill"><img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/images (26)~2.jpeg" alt=""><span>HTML</span></div>
      <div class="skill"><img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/images (2).png" alt=""><span>CSS</span></div>
      <div class="skill"><img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/images (3)~2.jpg" alt=""><span>Java</span></div>
      <div class="skill"><img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/download.jpeg" alt=""><span>Python</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="education">
    <h2>Education</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="edu">
        <img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/images (24).jpeg" alt="College Logo">
        <div>
          <h3>Bachelor of Science in Information Systems</h3>
          <p>Dr. Filemon C. Aguilar Memorial College of Las Piñas</p>
          <p class="muted">2025 – Present</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="edu">
        <img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/images (23).jpeg" alt="Senior high school Logo">
        <div>
          <h3>Senior High School, Strand</h3>
          <p>Las Piñas National Senior High School-Doña Josefa Campus</p>
          <p class="muted">2023 – 2025</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <div class="projects">
      <article class="project">
        <img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/Countdown timer_20261105_133117_0000.jpg" alt="Project One">
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Project One</h3>
          <p>A "Showing Soon" movie page with a live countdown timer and info cards for tickets, location, and a first-100-buyers promo.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="project">
        <img src="file:///storage/emulated/0/Android/data/com.teejay.trebedit/files/TrebEdit user files/Portfolio/Portfolio/received_2298773284308197.jpeg" alt="Project Two">
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Project Two</h3>
          <p>A pizza-themed login page with email and password fields, a show/hide password toggle, and links for forgot password and creating an account.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer>
  <p class="muted">© 2026 Meg Ryan Palo. Contact: <a href="mailto:megryanpalo9@gmail.com">megryanpalo@gmail.com</a></p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
